e":"Wrequis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T17:46:44-07:00","id":922317,"title":"","content":"Also still curious about my first questions","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1377-wrequis","name":"Wrequis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T03:59:45-07:00","id":924382,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wrequis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/921715-chambers-and-pathways#post921715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So one thing that has me intrigued is that chambers exist outside of those in lairs, but I'm curious, under the section of making chambers within a lair it says that a beast can do it if they come across the physical location, or the chamber itself which makes me wonder, can beasts enter chambers that aren't a part of their, or any other beasts, lair? If so do they merge with their beast/have any bonus for being a beast vs other supes?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Unusual sources of inspiration p96</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Beasts usually expand their Lairs and forge new Cham- bers from locations in the physical world; the Bright Dream of humanity contains re ections of all shared concepts, so hungry Horrors can still open Primordial Pathways to the Astral based on Chambers that were originally physical. Nothing, however, stops a Beast from using a more esoteric scene as the foundation of a Chamber. The requirements a location must meet to qualify as a Chamber are the same, whether the Beast is spreading Nightmares through the Underworld, ob- serving a mage fall from Wisdom in the Astral Realms, or chasing a changeling in the Hedge&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>My guess is that without help from a changeling or Mage, finding a chamber out in the primordial dream wouldn't be an option. looks like they meant was instead of using locations in the physical realm you can use places in the shadow, hedge, underworld etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1445-elesho","name":"elesho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1445_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-01T09:21:15-07:00","id":924492,"title":"","content":"You can cast yourself blind into any realm you can get into with Primordial Pathways (which is basically all of them) but its dangerous (Pg 97, -3 for choosing a realm but not a specific location). Once there you can search for a chamber the same as you would in the physical world, but it ironically faces the opposite problem in the material realm. In the physical world you're dealing with humans losing humanity by coming into contact with the supernatural, who are usually trying to hide from them. In the other realms you're dealing with the rare presence of humans losing integrity coming into contact with the abundant strange in other realms. The other criteria still apply of course, an exceptional success on a nightmare or something non-human losing integrity with you present.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10415-vermillionde","name":"VermillionDe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}